Cell["\<\
First we will make traditional Dirac matrices from direct sum of Pauli \
matrices  following textbooks procedures, see for example, Thiago T. Tsutsui, \
Edilberto O. Silva Antonio S. M. de Castro  and Fabiano M. Andrade, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]The Dirac equation: historical context, comparisons \
with the Schr\[ODoubleDot]dinger and Klein-Gordon    equations and elementary \
consequences\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], Eur. J. Phys. 46 053001 (2025); doi: \
10.1088/1361-6404/adf9a5    (arXiv:2504.17797v2)
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.983950166495659*^9, 3.9839502474416723`*^9}, {
  3.983952387595338*^9, 3.983952399070909*^9}, {3.9839562583903017`*^9, 
  3.983956407081388*^9}},
 CellID->1023601454,ExpressionUUID->"8304acbf-7e5d-4c16-9313-36550944e7ed"],

