Cell["\<\
In some algebras not all matrices can be represented by multivectors.  In \
particular if the algebra is represented by block diagonal matrices, then, of \
course, there is no way to represent full matrix in terms of MV of that \
algebra. Below we provide simple example for Cl(2,1)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
