Cell["\<\
Indeed all 7 matrices, which represents basis elements are different and, \
therefore, the representation is universal (see Jayme Vaz, Jr.; Roldao Da \
Rocha, Jr. \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]An Introduction to Clifford Algebras and \
Spinors\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], 2016,Oxford).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
