Cell["\<\
We see that in smaller representation we have less base elements! So these \
representations are not universal (see Jayme Vaz, Jr.; Roldao Da Rocha, Jr. \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]An Introduction to Clifford Algebras and Spinors\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], 2016,Oxford.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
