Cell["\<\
Direct substitution of Pauli matrices with  \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuaternionIsomorphismRules\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\[Rule]{\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Pauli[1,2]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]} would not \
yield real matrices \
\>", "Text",
